{
  "title": "ECS / EKS / Fargate · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "컨테이너 실행과 오케스트레이션의 선택지다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>ECS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Container Service)</span> / EKS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Kubernetes Service)</span> / Fargate</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#amazon-ecs\">Amazon ECS</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#task-definition-task-and-service\">Task Definition, Task and Service</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#amazon-eks\">Amazon EKS</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#aws-fargate\">AWS Fargate</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#ec2-compute-and-capacity-providers\">EC2 Compute and Capacity Providers</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#eks-auto-mode-and-managed-instances\">EKS Auto Mode and Managed Instances</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#amazon-ecr\">Amazon ECR</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#networking-and-load-balancing\">Networking and Load Balancing</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#task-role-and-execution-role\">Task Role and Execution Role</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>컴퓨팅</span><span>18 / 62</span></div><h1>ECS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Container Service)</span> / EKS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Kubernetes Service)</span> / Fargate</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 9 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>ECS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Container Service)</span>와 EKS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Kubernetes Service)</span>는 Container Orchestration을, Fargate는 Container를 실행할 Compute 방식 중 하나를 제공한다. 따라서 ECS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Container Service)</span>와 Fargate는 서로 완전히 대체되는 같은 종류의 서비스가 아니다.</p><p>Orchestration, Compute Capacity, Image Registry, Network·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a> 권한을 각각 고른다. Server 관리 최소화가 목표인지 Kubernetes API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 호환이 목표인지에 따라 선택이 달라진다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Orchestration과 Compute\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>Orchestration과 Compute</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>AWS-native orchestration</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#amazon-ecr\">ECR</a> Image</strong><small>Container 배포물</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>ECS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Container Service)</span> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#task-definition-task-and-service\">Task Definition</a> + Service</strong><small>실행 설정·원하는 Task 수</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Fargate / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></strong><small>Compute 선택</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Kubernetes orchestration</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Container Image</strong><small>동일한 Image 표준</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>EKS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Kubernetes Service)</span></strong><small>Kubernetes Control Plane</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Supported compute</strong><small>Node·Auto Mode·Fargate 비교</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">ECS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Container Service)</span>·EKS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Kubernetes Service)</span>는 Orchestration이며 Fargate는 Compute 선택지다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"amazon-ecs\"><h2>Amazon ECS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Container Service)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#amazon-ecs\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#task-definition-task-and-service\">Task Definition</a>으로 Image·CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span>·Memory·Port·Role 등을 정의하고 Task를 실행한다. Service는 원하는 Task 수를 유지하고 Load Balancer와 연계한다. AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 중심의 관리형 Orchestration을 원하는 경우에 적합하다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"task-definition-task-and-service\"><h2>Task Definition, Task and Service<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#task-definition-task-and-service\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#task-definition-task-and-service\">Task Definition</a>은 실행 Template, Task는 실제 실행 단위, Service는 장기 실행 Task의 수와 배포를 관리한다. 일회성 Batch와 상시 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>의 운영 형태를 구분한다. Image만 올린다고 Service가 자동 구성되는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"amazon-eks\"><h2>Amazon EKS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Kubernetes Service)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#amazon-eks\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>관리형 Kubernetes Control Plane을 제공한다. Kubernetes Deployment·Service·Ingress 등 Ecosystem을 사용할 수 있다. Control Plane이 관리형이어도 Worker Compute, Add-on, Network·권한과 버전 운영 책임을 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"aws-fargate\"><h2>AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Fargate<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#aws-fargate\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>지원 ECS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Container Service)</span> Task 또는 EKS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Kubernetes Service)</span> Pod에 서버 관리 없이 Compute를 제공한다. Task·Pod별 요구 CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span>·Memory·Network와 제약을 설정한다. Host에 대한 직접 제어나 특수 Workload가 필요하면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> 기반 Compute와 비교한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"ec2-compute-and-capacity-providers\"><h2>EC2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Compute Cloud)</span> Compute and Capacity Providers<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#ec2-compute-and-capacity-providers\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> 기반 ECS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Container Service)</span>·EKS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Kubernetes Service)</span>는 Instance Type과 Host 설정을 더 직접 관리한다. Capacity Provider·Managed Node Group 등으로 용량 운영을 돕는다. Compute 비용뿐 아니라 패치·Scaling·장애 처리 부담도 비교한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"eks-auto-mode-and-managed-instances\"><h2>EKS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Kubernetes Service)</span> Auto Mode and Managed Instances<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#eks-auto-mode-and-managed-instances\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#eks-auto-mode-and-managed-instances\">EKS Auto Mode</a>는 Compute·Networking·Storage 등 관리 범위를 확장한 모델이다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#eks-auto-mode-and-managed-instances\">ECS Managed Instances</a> 같은 최신 Compute 선택지도 있다. 기존 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> Node와 Fargate의 제약을 다른 관리형 모델에 그대로 적용하지 말고 지원 Feature를 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"amazon-ecr\"><h2>Amazon ECR <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Container Registry)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#amazon-ecr\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#reference-3\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 3\">[3]</a></h2><p>Container Image를 저장·배포하는 Registry다. Repository Policy, Image Scan, Lifecycle로 접근과 보존을 관리한다. Registry는 Task를 Scheduling하거나 실행하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"networking-and-load-balancing\"><h2>Networking and Load Balancing<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#networking-and-load-balancing\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>ECS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Container Service)</span> awsvpc 모델과 Fargate는 Task <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a>를 사용하며 Subnet 주소와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>을 설계한다. Kubernetes는 Pod·Service Network 모델과 CNI를 확인한다. 외부 진입에는 지원 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#network-load-balancer\">NLB</a> 등의 구성을 선택한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"task-role-and-execution-role\"><h2>Task Role and Execution Role<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#task-role-and-execution-role\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>ECS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Container Service)</span> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#task-role-and-execution-role\">Task Role</a>은 앱의 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 권한이고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#task-role-and-execution-role\">Task Execution Role</a>은 Image Pull·Log 전달 등 실행 준비에 사용하는 권한이다. EKS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Kubernetes Service)</span>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#task-role-and-execution-role\">Pod Identity</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#task-role-and-execution-role\">IRSA</a> 등 지원 Pod 권한 모델을 사용한다. Node의 광범위한 Role을 모든 앱이 공유하지 않도록 한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>Kubernetes 요구가 없는 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>에서 서버 운영을 줄이려면 ECS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Container Service)</span> Service와 Fargate를 비교한다. 기존 Kubernetes 운영 체계가 중요하면 EKS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Kubernetes Service)</span>의 Compute 선택지를 검토한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>Fargate는 컨테이너 오케스트레이터 자체가 아니다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonECS/latest/developerguide/Welcome.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AmazonECS/latest/developerguide/Welcome.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/eks/latest/userguide/what-is-eks.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">eks/latest/userguide/what-is-eks.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-3\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonECR/latest/userguide/what-is-ecr.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AmazonECR/latest/userguide/what-is-ecr.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q037/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q037\" data-question=\"Q037\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q037</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q037/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants a managed control plane while retaining the Kubernetes API and ecosystem. Which service should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q037\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon ECS only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q037\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q037\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Fargate only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q037\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EKS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/\">EKS</a>는 관리형 Kubernetes다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/\">Fargate</a>는 컨테이너 실행 인프라 선택지다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/\">ECS / EKS / Fargate</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q038\" data-question=\"Q038\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q038</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q038/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company runs ECS tasks and wants to reduce EC2 host patching and capacity management. Which compute option should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q038\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q038\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Fargate</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q038\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q038\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/\">ECS</a> 서비스를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/\">Fargate</a> 용량으로 실행할 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/\">ECS / EKS / Fargate</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q031\" data-question=\"Q031\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q031</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q031/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to add EC2 instances as web traffic changes and replace unhealthy instances. Which feature should it configure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q031\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q031\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q031\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q031\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS snapshots only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">ASG</a>가 원하는 용량과 확장 정책, 상태 확인을 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">EC2 Auto Scaling</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q084\" data-question=\"Q084\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1,2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q084</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q084/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which TWO components allow a stateless web tier to scale with demand and withstand an Availability Zone failure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q084\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EC2 instance with an Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q084\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer with targets in multiple AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q084\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EC2 Auto Scaling configured for multiple AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q084\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS volume shared from one AZ</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q084\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudTrail queries only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B, C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">ASG</a>가 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 용량을 유지·확장하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>가 건강한 대상으로 요청을 분산한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">EC2 Auto Scaling</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q032\" data-question=\"Q032\" data-revision=\"2\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q032</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q032/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company must use existing per-socket software licenses on EC2 and needs visibility into physical sockets and cores, plus control over instance placement on a specific host. Which option should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q032\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Instances</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q032\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Dedicated Hosts</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q032\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Compute Savings Plans</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q032\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Spot Instances</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Dedicated Hosts</a>는 Physical Host의 Socket·Core 가시성과 Instance Placement·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Host Affinity</a>를 제공한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-instances\">Dedicated Instances</a>는 전용 Hardware 격리를 제공하지만 같은 Host 제어·가시성을 제공하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">이전 용어 <b>EC2 Purchasing Options</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/\">다음 용어 <b>Edge Location</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
